Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:04.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}霍达尔 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 梅德韦杰夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Rafa, congrats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉法 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,on your first ATP Masters 1000 final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜首进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,We knew Daniil is brilliant hard court player,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们知道丹尼尔硬地很强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,one of the best of his generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,是同代最顶尖之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,He won here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,他以前在这里夺过冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, what did you do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么 你今天做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you prepare to go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛前你做了哪些准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,into this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,来应对这场比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean it was a very tough match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 这场比赛确实非常艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,首盘尤其如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,All the games were very very close,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一局都咬得非常紧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, with break points for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,他有破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,break points for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也有破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, super happy how I handled,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很开心 自己处理好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, the important moments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些关键分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first serve, in the first set, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃 首盘关键分 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And then also how I returned and served.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我的接发球和发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, Daniil's always a tough player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,丹尼尔一直很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I think he played great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得他今天打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So I have to give my best level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我必须拿出最佳水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能战胜他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Alejandro in the final tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天决赛对阵阿莱汉德罗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's going to be an all Spanish final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这将是一场西班牙德比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,for the first time in nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,九年来的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Does that make it even better for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这会让你感觉更特别吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it will be another tough game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 这又会是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,as every match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像每一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've played here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,像我在这里打过的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, try to get ready in the best shape
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我要调到最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,as possible and give my best tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天拼尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Best of luck tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你明天好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:03.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
